    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL INNOVATION AND BUSINESS MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "當今企業無不面臨數位化轉型之需求與壓力，本課程將結合產學領域專家分享最新的數位創新趨勢與案例，建立學生對於數位發展與創新的概念，並討論以數位創新建構新創事業或使企業成長的方向。",
    "describe_eh": "Under the pressure of digital transformation, we invite experts to discuss new digital innovation trends and cases. This course provides basic concepts about digital development and innovation. Students can understand how to build or grow their businesses.",
